  "description": "The Cutthroat C GRX 610 1x blends comfort, utility, and efficiency in a package that sets the standard for Tour Divide bikes. Cutthroat’s compliant carbon frame, our Class 5 VRS™ (vibration reduction system), and drop-bar mountain bike geometry come together for a confident, comfortable riding position you can sustain for long miles. Ample bikepacking bag mounts and rack mounts give you plenty of space for your sleep kit, snacks, and more. Shimano’s smooth GRX 610 1 x 12 drivetrain makes it easy to find the right gear for long climbs, hustling to the next resupply, and everything in between.",
